{
  "description": "Trials simulator — Roll samples one outcome from a weighted sample space and accumulates it into an observed-frequency histogram overlaid with expected-probability markers on a math-canvas; Run auto-samples on a tick. Default outcomes is a fair six-sided die; a coin flip, a weighted spinner, or any categorical distribution is just a different outcomes config. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
